95ec54a420b8f445e04a7ca0ea8deb72c51fe1d3 (upstream git master), but
the build fails with the following error:

```
[...]/fs/bcachefs/str_hash.c: In function =E2=80=98__bch2_str_hash_check_ke=
y=E2=80=99:
